@meeting crossingBackAddress.stay
// The Captain's final address, Stay (E-1, EN2; plans/ending-spec.html): after the oath, the crowd in the bow lounge.
// She names your choice to the crew: "We're keeping them". A stand-in for SW6's words.
title: The Captain's address
from: Captain Odile Marrow
gist: The Captain told the crew you're staying aboard the Wren.
== lines
marrow: One more thing, and then the supper. Some of you have heard. Headquarters offered {me} a post.   [gesture]
marrow: They said no. We're keeping them.
pell: Ha! Told you. Pay up, Halloran.   [laugh]
marrow > you: The Wren is home, then. Welcome home, {me}. Properly, this time.   [nod]
